Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.16,Default,,60,60,0,,Imagine escaping death,\Nnot once, but repeatedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:06.31,Default,,60,60,0,,This isn't sci-fi;\Nit's the bizarre reality
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:09.47,Default,,60,60,0,,of Earth's only biologically\Nimmortal creature. Meet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.47,0:00:12.63,Default,,60,60,0,,*Turritopsis dohrnii*, the\Nimmortal jellyfish. When faced
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:15.79,Default,,60,60,0,,with injury, old\Nage, or starvation, this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:18.94,Default,,60,60,0,,tiny marvel simply\Nreverts its cells. It
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:22.10,Default,,60,60,0,,transforms back into\Nits juvenile polyp stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:25.26,Default,,60,60,0,,essentially hitting a\Nbiological reset button. From
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:28.41,Default,,60,60,0,,there, it grows\Nanew, an endless cycle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:31.57,Default,,60,60,0,,of rebirth. Scientists\Nhave observed this process
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:34.73,Default,,60,60,0,,countless times in\Nlabs since its discovery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.88,Default,,60,60,0,,in the 1880s. It\Ndefies the fundamental
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:41.04,Default,,60,60,0,,law of nature: everything\Neventually dies. Could
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:44.20,Default,,60,60,0,,this microscopic\Nwonder hold the secret to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:46.45,Default,,60,60,0,,eternal youth for us all?